                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is so much fun!!! I`m a terrible driver, but I had my fill of fun trying to stop the other cars. It`s my best strategy since I always hit the wall lake a log. The forklift is really funny, but I really need to practice more. If it was a real gig, I would have been fired and probably loose my license!!! \nThe music is really uplifting. It reminds me of Rock`n roll racing! I would love to be able to shot the other cars!!!\nI`ll be playing much more and try to beat all the records!! Looking forward to new levels!!! It would double the fun!!!\n\n\n",
